  "trial_findings": [
    "Delta: translating the complete fairing masked the bronze room. Shortening it from the bow kept the aft seat clear. Reducing its beam cost 27.45 m across four rear rows. Restoring beam recovered the earlier 1.97 m mean.",
    "Glacier: a smooth single belt and equal width fractions across the two drawings missed the sweep. A more inward bend shortened the aft crossing. Seating the corridor farther inside a modeled pressure socket preserved all six contact checks.",
    "One walkway cleared its island by 13.89 m at the root. Seat the lower web at the actual island height and check the arm itself against both ship and station.",
    "Model checks and comparison sheets reuse the local Blender and elevation outputs."
  ],
